		<eira:iopSaliency><![CDATA[The Public Policy ABB  is salient for legal interoperability because it drives the production and formulation of legislation, and it is one of the main context elements to be taken into account when different organisations need to work together, as stated in the EIF: "Legal interoperability is about ensuring that organisations operating under different legal frameworks, policies and strategies are able to work together".]]></eira:iopSaliency>
