Overall, the Contracting Authority acts as a central entity responsible for managing the procurement of IT projects within the European IT context. It ensures transparency, fairness, and compliance with regulations, ultimately contributing to the successful implementation of IT solutions that benefit the European Union and its citizens.]]></skos:example>
