		<dcterms:title><![CDATA[Document Information]]></dcterms:title>
		<eira:definitionSource><![CDATA[WikiPedia]]></eira:definitionSource>
		<eira:definitionSourceReference><![CDATA[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Document]]></eira:definitionSourceReference>
