		<skos:example><![CDATA[The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): The Spanish Tax Agency is responsible for providing Digital Public Services on TAX payment. https://sede.agenciatributaria.gob.es/Sede/en_gb/iva.html]]></skos:example>
		<eira:iopSaliency><![CDATA[The Digital Public Service Provider ABB is salient for organizational and semantic interoperability because it offers (i) mechanisms to exchange information transparently; (ii) manage the information with needed security and trust; (iii) combine and harmonise information coming from multiple data stores to give service to the different agents (or stakeholders)]]></eira:iopSaliency>
		<skos:note><![CDATA[]]></skos:note>
