	<skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/DataQualityBusinessService">
		<skos:notation><![CDATA[Data Quality]]></skos:notation>
		<dcterms:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/DataQualityBusinessService</dcterms:identifier>
		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Data Quality]]></skos:prefLabel>
		<skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8" />
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Definition: Data Quality ABB is a Business Service that enables the implementation of an organization's data quality management capabilities, provisioned via a data quality service delivery mode by, or on behalf of an organization. A Data Quality Business Service comprises any data quality service exposed to ensure the accuracy, completeness, reliability, and timeliness of data within the organization.

Source: EIRA Team

LOST view: OV-Functional Architecture Principles

