		<skos:definition><![CDATA[Business Intelligence Service ims to provide actionable insights and a holistic view of the business, enabling organizations to make data-driven decisions, identify trends, uncover opportunities, and optimize performance. It involves the use of analytics tools, data visualization, reporting, and data mining techniques to extract valuable information from raw data.]]></skos:definition>
