Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/EArchivingBusinessService

Name: eArchiving Digital Public Service

Interoperability Layer: Organisational

Specialises: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/DigitalPublicBusinessService

]]></skos:definition>
