	</skos:Concept>
	<skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/GenericodeRepresentation">
		<skos:notation><![CDATA[Genericode]]></skos:notation>
		<dcterms:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/GenericodeRepresentation</dcterms:identifier>
		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Genericode]]></skos:prefLabel>
		<skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8" />
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Description: Genericode is a standardized format for defining and exchanging code lists and reference data. It provides a structured and machine-readable representation of code lists, which are collections of codes and their corresponding meanings or descriptions. Genericode is designed to facilitate interoperability and data exchange between different information systems.

Publisher: Advancement of Structured Information Standards (OASIS)

Source: https://docs.oasis-open.org/codelist/genericode/v1.0/cs02/genericode-v1.0-cs02.html

LOST view: SV-Functional Architecture Principles

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/GenericodeRepresentation

EIRA concept: eira:SolutionBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2024-01-28

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/GenericodeRepresentation

Interoperability Layer: Semantic

Realises: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/DataRepresentation

]]></skos:definition>
