		<dcterms:publisher><![CDATA[Advancement of Structured Information Standards (OASIS)]]></dcterms:publisher>
		<dcterms:description>Genericode is a standardized format for defining and exchanging code lists and reference data. It provides a structured and machine-readable representation of code lists, which are collections of codes and their corresponding meanings or descriptions. Genericode is designed to facilitate interoperability and data exchange between different information systems.</dcterms:description>
