		<eira:iopSaliency><![CDATA[The Linked Open Data Representation ABB is salient for semantic interoperability because it provides a set of publishing, sharing, and connection methods that allow linking and publishing the data from digital public services, making it more meaningful and increasing the quality and scope of data and services. Moreover, it increases data discoverability and maximises the reuse and exchange of data.]]></eira:iopSaliency>
