		<skos:definition xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Description: GeoJSON is a format for encoding geospatial data in JSON (JavaScript Object Notation). It provides a standard and flexible way to represent geographic features, such as points, lines, and polygons, along with their associated attributes.

Publisher: Internet Engineering Task Force (IETF)

Source: https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc7946

LOST view: SV-Functional Architecture Principles

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/GeoJSONRepresentation

