		<dcterms:description>RDF-XML (Resource Description Framework XML) is a syntax format used to represent metadata and structured data in the form of Resource Description Framework (RDF) triples. RDF-XML provides a way to encode and exchange data using XML (eXtensible Markup Language) syntax.</dcterms:description>
		<dcterms:source><![CDATA[https://www.w3.org/TR/rdf-syntax-grammar/]]></dcterms:source>
