		<skos:notation><![CDATA[SPARQL]]></skos:notation>
		<dcterms:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/SPARQLRepresentation</dcterms:identifier>
		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[SPARQL]]></skos:prefLabel>
		<skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8" />
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Description: SPARQL is a query language that enables organizations to extract valuable insights and knowledge from their semantic data. It plays a crucial role in the field of linked data and the semantic web, which focus on creating structured and interconnected data ecosystems.

Publisher: W3C

Source: https://www.bing.com/ck/a?!&&p=97d6e35279e66026JmltdHM9MTY4NzM5MjAwMCZpZ3VpZD0wMjYzNjViYy02Y2NlLTY1YzAtMDc1ZS03NzEwNmQ2NjY0NGYmaW5zaWQ9NTIwMA&ptn=3&hsh=3&fclid=026365bc-6cce-65c0-075e-77106d66644f&psq=sparwl*&u=a1aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnL1RSL3NwYXJxbDExLXF1ZXJ5Lw&ntb=1

LOST view: SV-Functional Architecture Principles

