	<skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/SKOSRepresentation">
		<skos:notation><![CDATA[SKOS]]></skos:notation>
		<dcterms:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/SKOSRepresentation</dcterms:identifier>
		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[SKOS]]></skos:prefLabel>
		<skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8" />
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Description:  SKOS plays a crucial role in improving information retrieval, data integration, and semantic interoperability, as it provides a standardized approach to representing and exchanging knowledge. By utilizing SKOS, businesses can enhance the discoverability and accessibility of their knowledge resources, leading to more effective search, navigation, and analysis of information within their systems and applications.

Publisher: W3C

Source: https://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/

LOST view: SV-Functional Architecture Principles

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/SKOSRepresentation

EIRA concept: eira:SolutionBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2024-01-28

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/SKOSRepresentation

Interoperability Layer: Semantic

Realises: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/DataRepresentation

]]></skos:definition>
