	</skos:Concept>
	<skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/AS4ProfileOfEbMS30V10Representation">
		<skos:notation><![CDATA[AS4 Profile of ebMS 3.0 v1.0]]></skos:notation>
		<dcterms:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/AS4ProfileOfEbMS30V10Representation</dcterms:identifier>
		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[AS4 Profile of ebMS 3.0 v1.0]]></skos:prefLabel>
		<skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8" />
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Description: The OASIS ebMS 3.0 Standard combined multiple Web Service standards to create a single comprehensive specification for defining the secure and reliable exchange of documents using Web Services. The AS4 profile of the ebMS 3.0 specification was developed in order to bring continuity to the principles and simplicity that made AS2 successful, while adding better compliance to Web Services standards, and features such as message pulling capability and a built-in Receipt mechanism.

Publisher: OASIS

Source: http://docs.oasis-open.org/ebxml-msg/ebms/v3.0/profiles/AS4-profile/v1.0/os/AS4-profile-v1.0-os.html

LOST view: SV-Functional Architecture Principles

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/AS4ProfileOfEbMS30V10Representation

EIRA concept: eira:SolutionBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2024-01-28

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/AS4ProfileOfEbMS30V10Representation

Interoperability Layer: Semantic

Realises: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/DataRepresentation

]]></skos:definition>
		<skos:broader rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/XMLRepresentation" />
		<egovera:AS4ProfileOfEbMS30V10Representation_Properties />
	</skos:Concept>
	<skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/AS4ProfileOfEbMS30V10Representation_Properties">
		<skos:notation><![CDATA[Properties of AS4 Profile of ebMS 3.0 v1.0]]></skos:notation>
		<dcterms:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/AS4ProfileOfEbMS30V10Representation_Properties</dcterms:identifier>
		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Properties of AS4 Profile of ebMS 3.0 v1.0]]></skos:prefLabel>
