		<dcterms:type>egovera:DataIntegrationApplicationComponent</dcterms:type>
		<skos:definition><![CDATA[Data Integration ABB is an Application Component that implements the process of combining data from different sources or systems into a unified view, ensuring consistency, accuracy, and accessibility. It involves transforming and merging data from various formats, structures, and locations to provide a comprehensive and integrated data set.]]></skos:definition>
		<eira:definitionSource><![CDATA[Wikipedia]]></eira:definitionSource>
		<eira:definitionSourceReference><![CDATA[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Data_integration]]></eira:definitionSourceReference>
