		<eira:iopSaliency><![CDATA[The Data Extraction, Transformation, and Loading Component ABB  is salient for technical interoperability  because it enables the implementation of the functionalities to transform internal data structures to common and agreed interoperable formats as stated in the EIF recommendation n° 41: "Establish procedures and processes to integrate the opening of data in your common business processes, working routines, and in the development of new information systems."]]></eira:iopSaliency>
