		<skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8" />
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Definition: Data Integration ABB is an Application Component that implements the process of combining data from different sources or systems into a unified view, ensuring consistency, accuracy, and accessibility. It involves transforming and merging data from various formats, structures, and locations to provide a comprehensive and integrated data set.

Source: Wikipedia

Source reference: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Data_integration

LOST view: Technical view - application

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/DataIntegrationApplicationComponent

ABB name: egovera:DataIntegrationApplicationComponent

EIRA concept: eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock

