		<eira:iopSaliency><![CDATA[The Service Registry Component ABB  is a key interoperability enabler because it supports to achieve technical interoperability by provisioning and consuming back-office services as stated in the EIF recommendation n°44: "Put in place catalogues of public services, public data, and interoperability solutions and use common models for describing them."]]></eira:iopSaliency>
