		<skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8" />
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Definition: The eNotification Application service refers to a software application or component that enables the electronic delivery of notifications, alerts, and messages to individuals or organizations. It operates at the application layer in a software architecture, providing the necessary functionality to create, manage, and distribute notifications through various channels

Source: International Journal of Engineering Research & Technology

Source reference: https://www.ijert.org/research/managing-user-notifications-in-enterprise-applications-IJERTV7IS010324.pdf

LOST view: TVA-API Enablers [Motivation]

