		<dcterms:description>The EBSI Wallet for Issuers is designed to enable organizations, such as universities, ministries, and other credential-issuing bodies, to manage and issue Verifiable Credentials (VCs) securely on the blockchain ledger. Under the EBSI (European Blockchain Services Infrastructure) Verifiable Credentials exchange framework, this wallet provides a robust platform for issuing and managing accreditations.</dcterms:description>
