	<skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/EclipseDataspaceConnectorApplicationService">
		<skos:notation><![CDATA[Eclipse Dataspace Connector]]></skos:notation>
		<dcterms:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/EclipseDataspaceConnectorApplicationService</dcterms:identifier>
		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Eclipse Dataspace Connector]]></skos:prefLabel>
		<skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8" />
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Description: An open source software for sovereign data exchange. It provides a set of modular components that can be used to connect different data spaces, support different transfer protocols, and manage data sharing and sovereignty.

Additional information: The Eclipse Dataspace Connector is a modular platform that can be used to build a variety of data exchange applications. It can be used to connect different data spaces, support different transfer protocols, and manage data sharing and sovereignty.

Example: For example, the Eclipse Dataspace Connector could be used to build an application that allows users to share data from different IoT devices. The application could use the Eclipse Dataspace Connector to connect to the different data spaces, transfer the data between the spaces, and manage the data sharing and sovereignty.

Publisher: Eclipse Foundation

Source: https://www.eclipse.org/dataspaceconnector/

LOST view: TVA-Data Space Enablers [Motivation]

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/EclipseDataspaceConnectorApplicationService

EIRA concept: eira:SolutionBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2024-01-28

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/EclipseDataspaceConnectorApplicationService

Name: Eclipse Dataspace Connector Application Service

Interoperability Layer: TechnicalApplication

Realises: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/DigitalSolutionApplicationService

]]></skos:definition>
