	<skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/KeycloakApplicationService">
		<skos:notation><![CDATA[Keycloak]]></skos:notation>
		<dcterms:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/KeycloakApplicationService</dcterms:identifier>
		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Keycloak]]></skos:prefLabel>
		<skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8" />
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Description: Keycloak is an open-source access management system that enables organizations to manage user authentication, authorization, and identity management for their applications and services. It provides a centralized platform for secure user authentication, single sign-on (SSO), and identity federation across multiple applications and systems.

Publisher: Keycloak

Source: https://www.keycloak.org/

LOST view: TVA-Identification and Access Enablers [Motivation]

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/KeycloakApplicationService

