		<dcterms:modified>2024-01-28</dcterms:modified>
		<dcterms:source><![CDATA[https://www.keycloak.org/]]></dcterms:source>
		<dcterms:publisher><![CDATA[Keycloak]]></dcterms:publisher>
		<dcterms:description>Keycloak is an open-source access management system that enables organizations to manage user authentication, authorization, and identity management for their applications and services. It provides a centralized platform for secure user authentication, single sign-on (SSO), and identity federation across multiple applications and systems.</dcterms:description>
