		<dcterms:description>Apache Storm is an open-source distributed real-time computation system. It provides a scalable and fault-tolerant platform for processing large streams of data in real-time, enabling organizations to analyze and react to data as it arrives. Storm allows users to define complex data processing workflows, known as topologies, which can handle high volumes of data with low latency.</dcterms:description>
