	<skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/TalendOpenStudioForDataIntegrationApplicationService">
		<skos:notation><![CDATA[Talend Open Studio for Data Integration]]></skos:notation>
		<dcterms:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/TalendOpenStudioForDataIntegrationApplicationService</dcterms:identifier>
		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Talend Open Studio for Data Integration]]></skos:prefLabel>
		<skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8" />
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Description: Talend Open Studio for Data Integration is an open-source software tool used for designing, developing, and deploying data integration processes. It provides a graphical interface that allows users to create data integration workflows, extract, transform, and load (ETL) data from various sources, and automate data integration tasks. The tool supports a wide range of data formats and connectivity options, enabling seamless integration with databases, cloud services, and other systems.

Additional information: Talend Open Studio for Data Integration is a comprehensive and flexible solution for managing data integration projects. It offers a user-friendly interface with drag-and-drop functionality, making it easy to design complex data integration workflows. The tool supports various data transformation operations, including filtering, sorting, aggregating, and joining data, allowing users to manipulate and cleanse data as per their requirements. It also provides extensive connectivity options, enabling integration with a wide range of data sources and targets. Talend Open Studio for Data Integration supports both batch and real-time data processing, making it suitable for a variety of use cases, such as data warehousing, business intelligence, and data migration. With its open-source nature, the tool benefits from a vibrant community of users and developers, ensuring continuous improvement and support.

Example: An example of using Talend Open Studio for Data Integration is in a retail company's data integration project. The company needs to extract data from multiple sources, such as their e-commerce platform, inventory management system, and customer relationship management (CRM) software. They can use Talend Open Studio to design a workflow that pulls data from these sources, performs data transformations to standardize formats and remove duplicates, and loads the cleansed data into a central data warehouse. This integrated data can then be used for generating reports, analyzing customer behavior, and making data-driven business decisions.

Publisher: Talend

Source: https://www.talend.com/products/data-integration/

LOST view: TVA-Data Management Enablers [Motivation]

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/TalendOpenStudioForDataIntegrationApplicationService

EIRA concept: eira:SolutionBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2024-01-28

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/TalendOpenStudioForDataIntegrationApplicationService

Name: Talend Open Studio for Data Integration Application Service

Interoperability Layer: TechnicalApplication

Realises: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/DigitalSolutionApplicationService

]]></skos:definition>
		<egovera:TalendOpenStudioForDataIntegrationApplicationService_Properties />
	</skos:Concept>
