		<skos:note><![CDATA[The EBSI is being developed by the European Commission in collaboration with member states and industry partners. It aims to promote the adoption of blockchain technology in the public sector by providing a trusted and efficient infrastructure. The EBSI leverages blockchain's decentralized and immutable nature to enhance transparency, security, and trust in digital transactions. It enables the creation of smart contracts, digital identity management, supply chain traceability, and other applications that require secure and tamper-proof data exchange. The EBSI also supports the integration of existing systems and services, ensuring seamless interoperability between different blockchain networks.]]></skos:note>
