	<skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/LearningPlatformSystemApplicationService">
		<skos:notation><![CDATA[Learning Platform System]]></skos:notation>
		<dcterms:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/LearningPlatformSystemApplicationService</dcterms:identifier>
		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Learning Platform System]]></skos:prefLabel>
		<skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8" />
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Definition: A Learning Platform System is a software application service that provides a comprehensive platform for managing and delivering learning content and experiences. It enables organizations to create, manage, and deliver various types of learning materials, such as courses, training modules, assessments, and educational resources. The Learning Platform System typically includes features such as content authoring, learner management, progress tracking, assessment tools, discussion forums, and collaboration capabilities. It supports both self-paced and instructor-led learning, fostering employee or user development, knowledge acquisition, and skill enhancement. The Learning Platform System application service facilitates efficient and effective learning experiences, enabling organizations to deliver training and educational programs in a centralized and scalable manner.

Source: Gartner

Source reference: https://www.gartner.com/en/documents/4002299

LOST view: TVA-Functional Architecture Principles

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/LearningPlatformSystemApplicationService

ABB name: egovera:LearningPlatformSystemApplicationService

EIRA concept: eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2023-11-20

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/LearningPlatformSystemApplicationService

Interoperability Layer: TechnicalApplication

Specialises: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/DigitalWorkplaceApplicationService

]]></skos:definition>
