		<eira:iopSaliency><![CDATA[The Metadata management Service ABB  is salient for interoperability  because it provides and shares the functionalities to manage metadata. EIF recommends to prioritise it: "Put in place an information management strategy at the highest possible level to avoid fragmentation and duplication. Management of metadata, master data and reference data should be prioritised".]]></eira:iopSaliency>
