Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/DataIntegrationApplicationService

Name: Data Integration Application Service

Interoperability Layer: TechnicalApplication

Specialises: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/DigitalSolutionApplicationService

]]></skos:definition>
