	<skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/KnowledgeManagementApplicationService">
		<skos:notation><![CDATA[Knowledge Management]]></skos:notation>
		<dcterms:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/KnowledgeManagementApplicationService</dcterms:identifier>
		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Knowledge Management]]></skos:prefLabel>
		<skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8" />
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Definition: A Knowledge Management Application Service is a software application or service that supports the processes of capturing, organizing, storing, retrieving, and sharing knowledge within an organization. It provides functionalities and tools to facilitate knowledge creation, acquisition, categorization, search, collaboration, and dissemination. The Knowledge Management Application Service typically includes features such as knowledge repositories, document management, collaboration platforms, content categorization, search capabilities, expertise location, and best practice sharing. It enables employees or users to access and leverage the organization's knowledge assets effectively, fostering innovation, decision-making, and continuous learning.

Source: International Journal of Computer Science Issues (IJCSI)

Source reference: http://ijcsi.org/papers/IJCSI-8-2-1-179-186.pdf

LOST view: TVA-Knowledge Discovery Enablers [Motivation]

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/KnowledgeManagementApplicationService

ABB name: egovera:KnowledgeManagementApplicationService

EIRA concept: eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2023-11-20

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/KnowledgeManagementApplicationService

Interoperability Layer: TechnicalApplication

Specialises: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/DataManagementApplicationService

]]></skos:definition>
