		<skos:example><![CDATA[The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): XMLGate - XMLGate is a Web service application used to validate an XML instance against a well-defined schema. The XML flow is submitted either via a PDF form or by uploading the XML file.(https://webgate.ec.europa.eu/sanco-xmlgate/Login.jsp;jsessionid=2MPn_N5Wg9Dar4_W2-yVL_Xg-VlW3kn47PLVbNise9X5Kycx1yLI!-25226473)]]></skos:example>
