		<skos:note><![CDATA[The eFiles Management Digital Service is a comprehensive solution that helps organizations transition from paper-based file management systems to digital ones. It encompasses a range of functionalities including document scanning and digitization, metadata tagging for easy search and retrieval, secure access controls to ensure data privacy and compliance with regulations, and audit trails for tracking document history. The service often integrates with other enterprise applications such as email, customer relationship management (CRM) systems, and enterprise resource planning (ERP) systems to streamline workflows and improve productivity. Additionally, it may offer features like automated workflows, electronic signatures, and mobile access to facilitate remote work and collaboration among team members.]]></skos:note>
