	<skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/EurostatDataCatalogueDataObject">
		<skos:notation><![CDATA[Eurostat Data Catalogue]]></skos:notation>
		<dcterms:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/EurostatDataCatalogueDataObject</dcterms:identifier>
		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Eurostat Data Catalogue]]></skos:prefLabel>
		<skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8" />
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Description: The EUROSTAT data catalogue is a comprehensive repository of statistical data and indicators maintained by EUROSTAT, the statistical office of the European Union (EU). It serves as a central platform for accessing a wide range of statistical information about the EU and its member states. The catalogue provides a structured and organized collection of datasets covering various domains such as economy, population, employment, agriculture, trade, and many others.

Publisher: Eurostat

Source: https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/web/main/home

LOST view: SV-Datasets Catalogue Solutions

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/EurostatDataCatalogueDataObject

