		<skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8" />
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Description: The Asset Description Metadata Schema (ADMS) is a standard metadata specification developed by the European Commission's ISA² program (Interoperability Solutions for European Public Administrations). ADMS is designed to facilitate the description and discovery of digital assets, particularly in the context of public administration.

Interoperability Dimension: Structural IoP

Publisher: W3C

Source: https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-adms/

LOST view: SV-Agnostic Ontologies

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/ADMSDataObject

