		<skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8" />
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Description: The Joint Research Center (JRC) Data Catalogue is a collection of metadata records that provides information about datasets produced by the Joint Research Centre (JRC) in accordance with its Data Policy. The JRC, as the European Commission's in-house science service, conducts research to provide independent scientific advice and support to the policies of the European Union.

Publisher: Joint Research Center (JRC)

Source: https://data.jrc.ec.europa.eu/

LOST view: SV-Metadata Catalogue

