		<dcterms:description>The Asset Description Metadata Schema (ADMS) is a standard metadata specification developed by the European Commission's ISA² program (Interoperability Solutions for European Public Administrations). ADMS is designed to facilitate the description and discovery of digital assets, particularly in the context of public administration.</dcterms:description>
		<dcterms:source><![CDATA[https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/support-centre/solution/asset-description-metadata-schema-adms/about]]></dcterms:source>
