		<eira:definitionSourceReference><![CDATA[https://docs.h5py.org/en/stable/vds.html]]></eira:definitionSourceReference>
		<skos:example><![CDATA[The following implementation is an example of how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): Virtual Datasets (VDS) is an example of a distribution for the creation of virtual datasets. https://docs.h5py.org/en/stable/vds.html]]></skos:example>
