	<skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/AuthorisedPaymentMethodsMetadataDataObject">
		<skos:notation><![CDATA[Authorised payment methods metadata]]></skos:notation>
		<dcterms:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/AuthorisedPaymentMethodsMetadataDataObject</dcterms:identifier>
		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Authorised payment methods metadata]]></skos:prefLabel>
		<skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8" />
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Definition: Authorised Payment Methods Metadata refers to structured information that provides details about the various payment methods that are accepted and authorized by a system or platform for financial transactions. It includes attributes such as payment method type, supported currencies, transaction limits, authentication requirements, and any additional metadata that helps define the characteristics and specifications of each payment method. Authorised Payment Methods Metadata enables seamless integration and processing of different payment methods, ensuring secure and efficient financial transactions.

Source: OpenAPI Specification (OAS)

Source reference: https://www.openapis.org/

LOST view: SV-Business Agnostic Metadata

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/AuthorisedPaymentMethodsMetadataDataObject

ABB name: egovera:AuthorisedPaymentMethodsMetadataDataObject

EIRA concept: eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2023-11-20

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/AuthorisedPaymentMethodsMetadataDataObject

Interoperability Layer: Semantic

Specialises: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/DataSetDataObject

]]></skos:definition>
