	<skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/SEMICCoreVocabulariesDataObject">
		<skos:notation><![CDATA[SEMIC Core Vocabularies]]></skos:notation>
		<dcterms:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/SEMICCoreVocabulariesDataObject</dcterms:identifier>
		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[SEMIC Core Vocabularies]]></skos:prefLabel>
		<skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8" />
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Description: The Core Vocabularies can be used by public administrations to attain a minimum level of semantic interoperability for e-Government systems. The Handbook explains how to (a) design new data models that extend the Core Vocabularies; and (b) map existing data models to the Core Vocabularies. 

Publisher: European Comission

Source: https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semic-support-centre/core-vocabularies

LOST view: Semantic view

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/SEMICCoreVocabulariesDataObject

EIRA concept: eira:SolutionBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2024-01-28

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/SEMICCoreVocabulariesDataObject

Interoperability Layer: Semantic

Realises: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ControlledVocabularyDataObject

]]></skos:definition>
