	<skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/OrderFormDataObject">
		<skos:notation><![CDATA[Order Form]]></skos:notation>
		<dcterms:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/OrderFormDataObject</dcterms:identifier>
		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Order Form]]></skos:prefLabel>
		<skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8" />
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Definition: The Order Form is essential for processing transactions, particularly in placing orders or making purchases. It usually includes fields for product or service selection, quantity, billing and shipping information, and payment details. This form streamlines the purchasing process, making it straightforward for customers to order goods or services, and for businesses to manage sales and inventory effectively.

Interoperability Dimension: Structural IoP

LOST view: SV-Forms Structure

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/OrderFormDataObject

