	<skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/ExchangeItemMetadataDataObject">
		<skos:notation><![CDATA[Exchange Item metadata]]></skos:notation>
		<dcterms:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/ExchangeItemMetadataDataObject</dcterms:identifier>
		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Exchange Item metadata]]></skos:prefLabel>
		<skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8" />
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Definition: Exchange Item Metadata refers to the structured information that provides descriptive and contextual details about an exchange item in a data exchange or integration process. It includes attributes such as the item's name, description, format, source, destination, and any additional metadata that helps define its characteristics and usage. Exchange Item Metadata serves as a standardized representation of the item's properties, enabling effective data integration, interoperability, and understanding across different systems and applications.

Source: W3C

Source reference: https://www.w3.org/standards/

LOST view: SV-Business Agnostic Metadata

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/ExchangeItemMetadataDataObject

ABB name: egovera:ExchangeItemMetadataDataObject

EIRA concept: eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2023-11-20

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/ExchangeItemMetadataDataObject

Interoperability Layer: Semantic

Specialises: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/DataSetDataObject

]]></skos:definition>
