		<dcterms:publisher><![CDATA[Publications Office of the European Union]]></dcterms:publisher>
		<dcterms:description>Authority tables (also known as Named Authority Lists or NALs are used to harmonise and standardise the codes and associated labels used in various environments (web platforms, systems and applications) and in facilitating data exchanges between the institutions involved in decision-making process and not only.</dcterms:description>
