	<skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/SurveyFormDataObject">
		<skos:notation><![CDATA[Survey Form]]></skos:notation>
		<dcterms:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/SurveyFormDataObject</dcterms:identifier>
		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Survey Form]]></skos:prefLabel>
		<skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8" />
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Definition: The Survey Form is designed for conducting detailed surveys or polls. It can encompass a variety of question types, including multiple-choice, Likert scales, and open-ended responses. This form is used to gather data on customer preferences, market trends, or public opinions, providing valuable insights that can guide business strategies, marketing efforts, and product development.

