		<dcterms:publisher><![CDATA[W3C]]></dcterms:publisher>
		<dcterms:description>DCAT enables a publisher to describe datasets and data services in a catalog using a standard model and vocabulary that facilitates the consumption and aggregation of metadata from multiple catalogs. This can increase the discoverability of datasets and data services.</dcterms:description>
		<dcterms:source><![CDATA[https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dcat-2/]]></dcterms:source>
