	<skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/RegistrationFormDataObject">
		<skos:notation><![CDATA[Registration Form]]></skos:notation>
		<dcterms:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/RegistrationFormDataObject</dcterms:identifier>
		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Registration Form]]></skos:prefLabel>
		<skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8" />
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Definition: The Registration Form is used for enrolling users or participants in services, events, or online platforms. It typically requires personal information, such as name, age, contact details, and sometimes specific preferences or qualifications. This form is key for organizing events, managing subscriptions, or registering users for online services, helping businesses maintain organized records of participants and tailor their offerings accordingly.

Interoperability Dimension: Structural IoP

LOST view: SV-Forms Structure

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/RegistrationFormDataObject

ABB name: egovera:RegistrationFormDataObject

EIRA concept: eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2023-11-20

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/RegistrationFormDataObject

Interoperability Layer: Semantic

Specialises: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/FormsStructureDataObject

]]></skos:definition>
