		<skos:note><![CDATA[Solution Builsing Block ABB is formulated as an agreed normative statement in design terms on a legal, organisational, semantic, or technical attribute of an European Public Service. On the technical view, a Solution Building Block is a specific software component that it might be either procured or developed of a To-Be Interoperable European Solution or that it is integrated in an As-Is Interoperable European Solution]]></skos:note>
