		<skos:note><![CDATA[The Data Spaces Business Alliance is a global initiative established by a group of leading technology companies, including Atos, Dell Technologies, Google Cloud, IBM, Intel, Microsoft, and SAP. The alliance aims to create a trusted and secure data sharing environment that enables businesses to collaborate and innovate through shared data spaces. 

