		<skos:example><![CDATA[The following implementation is an example of how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): Opinion of the European Economic and Social Committee on Next Generation SME Strategy — Enhancing Effective and Swift Delivery (own-initiative opinion). https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX%3A52021IE3668&qid=1664779252884]]></skos:example>
