		<eira:PURI>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/DigitalSolutionNon-FunctionalRequirementRequirement</eira:PURI>
		<dcterms:type>eira:DigitalSolutionNon-FunctionalRequirementRequirement</dcterms:type>
		<dcterms:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/DigitalSolutionNon-FunctionalRequirementRequirement</dcterms:identifier>
		<skos:definition><![CDATA[The [Digital Solution Non-Functional Requirement] ABB refers to criteria that specify the operational qualities such as performance, security, usability, and reliability of a digital solution, rather than its specific behaviors or functions.]]></skos:definition>
