		<skos:note><![CDATA[According to the TOGAF specification, Deployment stamps are a non-functional requirement that pertains to the deployment of software applications. This requirement specifies that each deployment of the software application must be stamped with a unique identifier that indicates the version of the application that has been deployed. 

