Overall, the Replication requirement is critical for ensuring that a system can provide high availability, fault tolerance, and disaster recovery capabilities. It is important to carefully consider the specific sub-requirements and techniques that will be used to achieve this requirement in order to ensure that the system is able to meet its performance and reliability goals.]]></skos:note>
