		<skos:definition><![CDATA[Legal Entity ABB is a Stakeholder that is a self-empoyed person, company, or organization that has legal rights and obligations.]]></skos:definition>
		<eira:definitionSource><![CDATA[SEMIC-CBV]]></eira:definitionSource>
