		<skos:example><![CDATA[The following implementation is an example of how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): Any instance of Business, Public Administration with legal personality or a Natural person. https://commission.europa.eu/publications/legal-entities_en]]></skos:example>
		<eira:iopSaliency><![CDATA[The Legal Entity ABB is salient for organizational and behavioural interoperability because it permits the identification of procedures and business rules related to this stakeholder that facilitates the exchange of data, information and knowledge between digital public services.]]></eira:iopSaliency>
