		<skos:definition><![CDATA[Business Agnostic EU Vocabularies Reference Data Solutions (BAEUV RDS) is a grouping that covers a range of information entities designed to support and enhance the efficiency of the Single Market. It includes elements such as NUTS, Reference Data Asset, Authority Tables, and the Digital Europe Thesaurus. These elements aim to standardize and harmonize codes, labels, and other forms of data across various platforms and systems, facilitating effective communication and data exchange.]]></skos:definition>
		<eira:definitionSource><![CDATA[EIRA Team Research]]></eira:definitionSource>
