		<skos:note><![CDATA[Privacy Solutions ABB is a collection of digital services solutions that are primarily focused on providing secure and private storage and access to sensitive data. The group includes tools like HashiCorp Vault, an open-source tool designed for securely storing and accessing sensitive information. Vault provides a centralized system for managing secrets and ensures their secure distribution across applications and systems. The primary purpose of these solutions is to ensure that sensitive data, such as passwords, API keys, and encryption keys, are securely stored and only accessible to authorized entities. These solutions are critical in maintaining data privacy and security in various digital environments, including cloud-based systems, mobile applications, and other digital platforms.]]></skos:note>
