		<skos:definition><![CDATA[Observability Requirements Catalogue ABB is a grouping that covers non-functional requirements related to system monitoring, logging, and tiered levels of support. These requirements are critical for ensuring the reliability, availability, performance, security, and effective use of IT systems and applications.]]></skos:definition>
