Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/BusinessAgnosticOrganisationalGovernanceFrameworksCatalogueGrouping

Name: Organisational Governance Frameworks Catalogue Catalogue

Interoperability Layer: Organisational

]]></skos:definition>
