		<skos:definition><![CDATA[Organisational Governance Frameworks Catalogue ABB is a grouping that covers a set of business objects that enable the protection, confidentiality, and interoperability of data, information, and knowledge assets and the organizational resources handling them. It includes the Security Framework, Privacy Framework, and Interoperability Framework.]]></skos:definition>
