		<skos:note><![CDATA[The Organisational Governance Frameworks Catalogue ABB is a comprehensive collection of frameworks that are designed to guide organizations in managing and protecting their data and information assets. The Security Framework focuses on the protection of these assets and the resources handling them. The Privacy Framework, on the other hand, emphasizes the confidentiality aspects of these assets and resources. Lastly, the Interoperability Framework is designed to enable organizations to collaborate effectively towards the joint delivery of public services. It does this by specifying a set of common elements such as vocabulary, concepts, principles, guidelines, and recommendations.]]></skos:note>
