	<skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/BusinessAgnosticOrchestrationSolutionsGrouping">
		<skos:notation><![CDATA[Business Agnostic Orchestration Solutions]]></skos:notation>
		<dcterms:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/BusinessAgnosticOrchestrationSolutionsGrouping</dcterms:identifier>
		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Business Agnostic Orchestration Solutions]]></skos:prefLabel>
		<skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8" />
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Description: Orchestration Solutions ABB is a grouping that refers to actual solutions that facilitate the management, scheduling, and monitoring of complex workflows and data processing pipelines. These solutions are primarily used for orchestrating tasks across different systems and technologies, and for building both batch and streaming data processing pipelines.

Additional information: Orchestration Solutions ABB includes tools like Apache Airflow and Apache Beam. Apache Airflow is an open-source platform used for authoring, scheduling, and monitoring workflows. It allows users to define complex workflows as code, making it easier to manage and orchestrate tasks across different systems and technologies. Apache Beam, on the other hand, is an open-source unified programming model and set of tools for building batch and streaming data processing pipelines. It provides a high-level API that allows developers to write data processing logic once and execute it on various distributed processing backends.

Example: Examples of application for Orchestration Solutions ABB include using Apache Airflow to automate the execution of SQL queries and data transfers, or using Apache Beam to build a data processing pipeline that can handle both real-time and batch data.

Publisher: EIRA Team Research

LOST view: TVA-Orchestration Enablers [Motivation]

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/BusinessAgnosticOrchestrationSolutionsGrouping

EIRA concept: eira:SolutionBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2024-01-28

