		<skos:example><![CDATA[Examples of Blockchain Solutions ABB include blockchain-based supply chain management systems that provide end-to-end visibility and traceability of goods, blockchain-based financial systems that enable secure and transparent transactions, and blockchain-based healthcare systems that ensure the security and privacy of patient data. Another example is the use of blockchain for energy trading, where ABB has developed a solution that allows for peer-to-peer energy transactions, improving efficiency and reducing costs.]]></skos:example>
