Last modification: 2024-01-28

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/DigitalSolutionNon-FunctionalRequirementsCatalogueGrouping

Name: Digital Solution Non-Functional Requirements Catalogue Catalogue

Interoperability Layer: N/A

]]></skos:definition>
