		<dcterms:type>eira:DigitalSolutionNon-FunctionalRequirementsCatalogueGrouping</dcterms:type>
		<skos:definition><![CDATA[Interoperability Non-Functional Requirements Catalogue ABB is a Grouping of technical specifications and capabilities that enable different systems, applications, or devices to exchange information and work together seamlessly]]></skos:definition>
		<eira:definitionSource><![CDATA[EIRA Team Research]]></eira:definitionSource>
