		<skos:example><![CDATA[An example of applying the Digital Solution Non-Functional Requirements Catalogue ABB could be during the design and development of a new digital banking application. The developers would need to consider various non-functional requirements such as Security (to protect users' financial information), Availability (to ensure the app is always accessible), Usability (to ensure the app is user-friendly), Scalability (to handle increasing number of users), and Extensibility (to easily add new features in the future). Additionally, they would also need to consider sub-elements such as Confidentiality and Integrity under Security, Accessibility and Learnability under Usability, and Disaster Recovery and Recoverability under Resiliency.]]></skos:example>
