		<skos:example><![CDATA[These vocabularies can be used by government agencies to standardize data exchange and communication, ensuring consistency and interoperability across different systems and platforms.

This vocabulary can be used by businesses to assess various types of assets based on specific criteria, ensuring a standardized and comprehensive assessment process.

