		<skos:definition><![CDATA[Business Agnostic Organisational Agreement Solutions (BAOAS) is a grouping that refers to the actual catalogue of specifications, agreements and/or contracts that facilitates the establishment of standardised business practices across various industries. This catalogue includes a variety of elements, such as codes of conduct, guidelines, and best practices, which are designed to improve operational efficiency, promote ethical business practices, and enhance environmental sustainability.]]></skos:definition>
