		<skos:definition><![CDATA[Business Agnostic Data Policy Catalogue ABB is a grouping that covers a range of policies and guidelines designed to manage and control data assets within an organization. These policies ensure seamless interoperability between different systems, maintain data quality, govern data usage, and manage data within a blockchain network. The catalogue is business agnostic, meaning it can be applied across various industries and business models.]]></skos:definition>
