		<skos:example><![CDATA[Examples of application of Data Integration Solutions ABB include integrating data from different departments in a large organization to provide a unified view of the organization's operations, consolidating customer data from various channels in a retail business to improve customer service and personalization, and synchronizing data between an organization's on-premise systems and cloud-based applications to enhance data accessibility and scalability.]]></skos:example>
		<skos:note><![CDATA[Data Integration Solutions ABB includes a wide range of digital services and solutions such as data warehousing, data migration, data consolidation, data synchronization, and data transformation. These solutions enable organizations to integrate data from various sources, including databases, applications, and systems, both within and outside the organization. They help in ensuring data consistency, accuracy, and accessibility, thereby improving data quality and reliability. Furthermore, they support real-time data integration, allowing organizations to make timely and informed decisions.]]></skos:note>
		<eira:concept>eira:SolutionBuildingBlock</eira:concept>
		<dcterms:description>Data Integration Solutions ABB is a grouping that refers to actual solutions that facilitate the process of combining data from different sources into a single, unified view. These solutions help organizations to effectively manage, govern, and integrate their data to improve efficiency, decision-making, and strategic planning.</dcterms:description>
		<dcterms:publisher><![CDATA[EIRA Team Research]]></dcterms:publisher>
