		<skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8" />
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Definition: Dataspace Solutions ABB is a grouping that refers to actual solutions that facilitate the management, integration, and utilization of data in a secure and efficient manner. These solutions provide a platform for data sharing, collaboration, and analytics, enabling businesses to make data-driven decisions and gain competitive advantage.

Source: EIRA Team Research

