		<eira:synonym></eira:synonym>
		<skos:definition><![CDATA[Semantic Governance Content ABB is a Grouping of the concepts and terms to support the elaboration of rules and mechanisms to enhance the availability, integrity, interoperability and  security of data while respecting data protection and ethical rules]]></skos:definition>
