Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/DigitalSolutionScalabilityArchitectureDecisionCatalogueGrouping

Name: Digital Solution Scalability Architecture Decision Catalogue Catalogue

Interoperability Layer: N/A

]]></skos:definition>
