Last modification: 2024-01-28

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/DigitalSolutionArchitectureDecisionCatalogueGrouping

Name: Digital Solution Architecture Decision Catalogue Catalogue

Interoperability Layer: N/A

]]></skos:definition>
