Last modification: 2023-11-20

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/EProcurementDataModelGrouping

Name: EProcurement Data Model Catalogue

Interoperability Layer: Semantic

]]></skos:definition>
		<skos:related rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/ESPD-EDMDataObject" />
