		<skos:definition><![CDATA[eProcurement Data Model ABB is a grouping that covers essential elements related to public procurement processes within the European Union. It specifically includes the European Single Procurement Document (ESPD) as a key component, which is a standardized form used in these processes.]]></skos:definition>
