		<skos:note><![CDATA[The ENBI catalogue includes key documents such as the 'European Interoperability Framework - Implementation Strategy', which outlines the Commission's strategy for implementing interoperability across the EU. It also includes the 'Strengthened Code of Practice on Disinformation', a document aimed at combating the spread of false information online. The 'Declaration for the Future of Internet' and 'Declaration on Digital Rights and Principles' set out the EU's vision for a free, open and secure internet, while the 'Recommendation on Building a Joint Cyber Unit' and 'Recommendation on a trusted and secure European e-ID' provide specific recommendations for enhancing cybersecurity and digital identity within the EU.]]></skos:note>
