	<skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/BusinessAgnosticMessagingSolutionsGrouping">
		<skos:notation><![CDATA[Business Agnostic Messaging Solutions]]></skos:notation>
		<dcterms:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/BusinessAgnosticMessagingSolutionsGrouping</dcterms:identifier>
		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Business Agnostic Messaging Solutions]]></skos:prefLabel>
		<skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8" />
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[Description: Messaging Solutions ABB is a grouping that refers to actual solutions that facilitate the exchange of information through digital messages. These solutions can include email, SMS, instant messaging, push notifications, and other forms of digital communication. They are designed to streamline and simplify the process of sending, receiving, and managing messages in a digital environment.

Additional information: Messaging solutions are an integral part of modern communication, especially in business environments. They can be used for a variety of purposes, including customer service, marketing, internal communication, and more. These solutions often include features like automation, personalization, analytics, and integration with other systems. They can be used to send messages to individuals or groups, and can support various types of content, including text, images, videos, and links. Messaging solutions can also include security features to protect the privacy and integrity of the messages.

Example: Examples of messaging solutions include email marketing platforms like MailChimp, customer service chatbots, internal communication tools like Slack, and SMS marketing services. These solutions can be used in a variety of contexts. For example, a business might use an email marketing platform to send promotional messages to customers, a chatbot to answer customer inquiries, and an internal communication tool to facilitate communication among employees.

Publisher: EIRA Team Research

LOST view: TVA-Messaging Enablers [Motivation]

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/BusinessAgnosticMessagingSolutionsGrouping

EIRA concept: eira:SolutionBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2024-01-28

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/BusinessAgnosticMessagingSolutionsGrouping

Name: Messaging SolutionsGrouping

Interoperability Layer: TechnicalApplication

Realises: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/DigitalSolutionApplicationService

]]></skos:definition>
