		<skos:definition><![CDATA[Not Implemented Architecture Principles Catalogue ABB is a grouping that covers the collection of architecture principles that have not been implemented in a specific solution architecture. It serves as a repository for documenting these omissions, providing transparency and understanding of the architectural choices made.]]></skos:definition>
