		<skos:definition><![CDATA[Business Agnostic Digital Public Services Catalogue ABB is a grouping that refers to the actual catalogue of digital public services that facilitates the seamless integration and interoperability of various IT systems and services provided by the European Commission. It encompasses a wide range of elements, each with a specific role in enhancing the efficiency, accessibility, and user experience of digital public services, while promoting interoperability across different platforms and systems.]]></skos:definition>
