		<skos:definition><![CDATA[Shared Infrastructure Content ABB is a Grouping setting infrastructure (re)usable resources, with convergence power, in relation to public policy goals attainment, enabling to reuse and share IT resources to support technical aspects for the infrastructure of interoperable Digital Public Services. It provides a unified IT environment encompassing hardware, software, and processes, promoting secure and efficient resource utilization across multiple stakeholders. This shared infrastructure ensures data integrity, operational efficiency, and effective collaboration while maintaining strict data and operational separation for confidentiality and reliability.]]></skos:definition>
