		<skos:definition><![CDATA[Business Agnostic Data Models Solutions ABB is a grouping that covers a set of data models that are universally applicable across various business domains. This catalogue includes the Common Data Model (CDM) and the eProcurement Data Model, both of which are designed to standardize and streamline data management processes in their respective fields.]]></skos:definition>
